text Naranja_NewIsland_Gym_1F_Text_0818E8A5 {
    "Yo! How’s it going, CHAMPION-\nbound {PLAYER}?\pSOOTOPOLIS’s GYM LEADER WALLACE is\na master of WATER-type POKéMON.\pAnd, to get to WALLACE, an icy floor\nwill hamper your progress...\pListen, I’m sorry, but that’s all the\nadvice that I have for you.\pThe rest of the way, you have to\ngo for it yourself!"
}

text Naranja_NewIsland_Gym_1F_Text_0818E9C9 {
    "Yow! You’ve beaten even WALLACE, who\nwas supposedly the best in all HOENN!\pOkay! Check out your TRAINER’s CARD.\pIf you’ve gotten all the BADGES, you’re\nset for the POKéMON LEAGUE challenge!"
}

text Naranja_NewIsland_Gym_1F_Text_0818F0CA {
    "Allow me to formally introduce\nmyself.\pI am WALLACE.\nThe GYM LEADER of SOOTOPOLIS.\pThere’s something about you...\nA difference in your demeanor.\pI think I sense that in you.\pWhat happened inside the CAVE OF\nORIGIN, and what you did, I will likely\llearn through our upcoming battle.\pNow, show me. Show me the power you\nwield with your POKéMON.\pAnd I, in turn, shall present you with\na performance of illusions in water\lby me and my POKéMON!"
}

text Naranja_NewIsland_Gym_1F_Text_0818F282 {
    "Bravo.\pI realize now your authenticity and\nmagnificence as a POKéMON TRAINER.\pI find much joy in having met you and\nyour POKéMON.\pYou have proven yourself worthy of\nthe RAIN BADGE. Accept it."
}

text Naranja_NewIsland_Gym_1F_Text_0818F342 {
    "{PLAYER} received the RAIN BADGE\nfrom WALLACE."
}

text Naranja_NewIsland_Gym_1F_Text_0818F36B {
    "Having that BADGE assures you the\nfull obedience of all your POKéMON to\levery command you make.\pThe BADGE also allows the use of the\nHM move WATERFALL to scale walls\lof cascading water.\pAnd, so that you never forget the\nbattle we shared, take this..."
}

text Naranja_NewIsland_Gym_1F_Text_0818F466 {
    "The TM I handed you contains\nWATER PULSE.\pIn use, it will occasionally confuse\nthe target with ultrasonic waves."
}

text Naranja_NewIsland_Gym_1F_Text_0818F4D7 {
    "TRAINERS who have gathered all the\nGYM BADGES of HOENN should make way\lfor the ultimate destination.\pThe POKéMON LEAGUE.\pTravel to the easternmost reaches\nof HOENN, to the island EVER GRANDE.\lThe POKéMON LEAGUE is there."
}

text Naranja_NewIsland_Gym_1F_Text_0818F5B4 {
    "There remains but one BADGE to\nobtain in HOENN.\pIf you wish to challenge the POKéMON\nLEAGUE, you must obtain the last\lBADGE from the GYM in FORTREE."
}

text Naranja_NewIsland_Gym_1F_Text_0818F649 {
    "SOOTOPOLIS CITY POKéMON GYM"
}

text Naranja_NewIsland_Gym_1F_Text_0818F665 {
    "SOOTOPOLIS CITY POKéMON GYM\pWALLACE’S CERTIFIED TRAINERS:\n{PLAYER}"
}
